---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const title = `Technology | ${SITE_TITLE}`;
const description = 'Explore the engineering behind AlienX through interactive demonstrations of frontend systems, backend architecture, automation, performance, accessibility, and infrastructure.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={title} description={description} /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">ALIENX / TECHNOLOGY</p>
          <h1>Built from the <span>web outward.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">AlienX treats the browser as an engineering surface, not a box around an application. Frontend, backend, automation, infrastructure, and performance all become part of one system.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="hero-link hero-link--primary" href="#capabilities">Explore the system <span>↓</span></a>
            <a class="hero-link" href="/experience">Operate the experience <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-console" aria-label="Live technology console">
          <div class="console-top"><span>ALIENX ENGINE</span><span class="live-dot">LIVE</span></div>
          <div class="console-screen"><div class="console-grid"></div><div class="console-orbit console-orbit--one"></div><div class="console-orbit console-orbit--two"></div><div class="console-core"><span>AX</span></div><div class="console-readout"><span>RUNTIME</span><strong>EDGE / BROWSER</strong></div></div>
          <div class="console-bottom"><span>INPUT READY</span><span>0 DEPENDENCIES REQUIRED</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="capabilities" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
        <div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">01 / CAPABILITIES</p><h2 id="capabilities-title">A technology stack is useful only when it can <span>do something.</span></h2><p>These are demonstrations of the kinds of systems AlienX can design, connect, optimize, and ship.</p></div>
        <div class="capability-grid">
          <article class="capability-card capability-card--wide"><div class="card-index">01</div><p class="card-kicker">FRONTEND ENGINEERING</p><h3>Interfaces that behave like software.</h3><p>Responsive layouts, stateful components, animation, semantic HTML, progressive enhancement, and browser-native APIs can work together without unnecessary abstraction.</p><div class="frontend-demo"><div class="demo-window"><div class="window-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>interactive-component</span></div><div class="window-body"><div class="signal-ring" data-signal-ring></div><div><small>COMPONENT STATE</small><strong data-component-state>READY</strong></div></div></div><div class="demo-controls"><button type="button" data-component-action="activate">Activate</button><button type="button" data-component-action="reset">Reset</button></div></div></article>
          <article class="capability-card"><div class="card-index">02</div><p class="card-kicker">BACKEND / APIs</p><h3>Logic that has somewhere to go.</h3><p>Request validation, typed payloads, API boundaries, server-side work, data flows, and failure handling keep the browser from carrying responsibilities it should not own.</p><div class="api-demo"><div><span>POST</span><strong>/api/inquiry</strong></div><output data-api-status>READY</output><button type="button" data-api-run>Simulate request</button></div></article>
          <article class="capability-card"><div class="card-index">03</div><p class="card-kicker">AUTOMATION</p><h3>Systems that remove repetition.</h3><p>Events can trigger workflows across services, APIs, notifications, content, and operational tasks. The useful part is the connection between them.</p><div class="automation-demo" data-automation-demo><div class="automation-node is-active">EVENT</div><span>→</span><div class="automation-node">FILTER</div><span>→</span><div class="automation-node">ACTION</div><button type="button" data-automation-run>Run workflow</button></div></article>
          <article class="capability-card capability-card--wide"><div class="card-index">04</div><p class="card-kicker">INFRASTRUCTURE</p><h3>From source code to runtime.</h3><p>Deployment, edge delivery, DNS, environment configuration, observability, caching, and secure service boundaries are part of the product.</p><div class="infra-map"><div class="infra-node"><small>SOURCE</small><strong>GIT</strong></div><div class="infra-line"></div><div class="infra-node"><small>BUILD</small><strong>ASTRO</strong></div><div class="infra-line"></div><div class="infra-node infra-node--edge"><small>RUNTIME</small><strong>EDGE</strong></div><div class="infra-branches"><span>WEB</span><span>API</span><span>ASSETS</span></div></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lab" aria-labelledby="lab-title"><div class="lab-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE LAB</p><h2 id="lab-title">See the browser <span>work.</span></h2><p>Different engineering problems need different answers. The point is the system behind the interface.</p></div><div class="lab-grid">
        <article class="lab-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><small>PERFORMANCE</small><h3>Critical path</h3></div><span>OPTIMIZED</span></div><div class="perf-bars"><div><span>HTML</span><i style="--value:18%"></i><b>18 ms</b></div><div><span>CSS</span><i style="--value:31%"></i><b>31 ms</b></div><div><span>JS</span><i style="--value:44%"></i><b>44 ms</b></div><div><span>PAINT</span><i style="--value:26%"></i><b>26 ms</b></div></div><button type="button" class="lab-button" data-perf-run>Run measurement</button></article>
        <article class="lab-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><small>ACCESSIBILITY</small><h3>Interface audit</h3></div><span>4 / 4</span></div><ul class="audit-list"><li><span>✓</span><div><strong>Semantic structure</strong><small>Landmarks and headings</small></div></li><li><span>✓</span><div><strong>Keyboard access</strong><small>Controls remain operable</small></div></li><li><span>✓</span><div><strong>Visible focus</strong><small>Interaction has a visual target</small></div></li><li><span>✓</span><div><strong>Reduced motion</strong><small>Animation respects preference</small></div></li></ul></article>
        <article class="lab-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><small>DATA FLOW</small><h3>Payload inspector</h3></div><span data-payload-status>VALID</span></div><pre><code data-payload-code></code></pre><button type="button" class="lab-button" data-payload-toggle>Mutate payload</button></article>
      </div></section>

      <section class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title"><div class="architecture-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / ARCHITECTURE</p><h2 id="architecture-title">Use the platform <span>instead of fighting it.</span></h2><p>AlienX favors a small, understandable set of primitives. Frameworks and services are valuable when they solve a real constraint.</p></div><div class="architecture-stack"><button class="arch-layer is-selected" type="button" data-layer="frontend"><span>01</span><div><strong>Frontend</strong><small>HTML · CSS · JavaScript · UI systems</small></div><b>+</b></button><button class="arch-layer" type="button" data-layer="backend"><span>02</span><div><strong>Backend</strong><small>APIs · validation · data · integrations</small></div><b>+</b></button><button class="arch-layer" type="button" data-layer="automation"><span>03</span><div><strong>Automation</strong><small>Events · workflows · services · AI</small></div><b>+</b></button><button class="arch-layer" type="button" data-layer="infrastructure"><span>04</span><div><strong>Infrastructure</strong><small>Cloud · edge · DNS · observability</small></div><b>+</b></button><div class="arch-detail" data-arch-detail>Browser-native interaction, responsive composition, semantic structure, and focused client-side state.</div></div></section>

      <section class="principles"><div class="principles-head"><p class="eyebrow">04 / ENGINEERING</p><h2>The details are part of the <span>feature.</span></h2></div><div class="principle-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Progressive enhancement</h3><p>The document remains useful before JavaScript arrives.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Performance as design</h3><p>Asset weight, rendering work, and network boundaries shape experience.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Accessible interaction</h3><p>Semantics, keyboard behavior, focus, contrast, and motion are requirements.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Observable systems</h3><p>Useful telemetry and clear boundaries make production behavior diagnosable.</p></article><article><span>05</span><h3>Secure by construction</h3><p>Validation, least privilege, secret handling, and dependency discipline matter.</p></article><article><span>06</span><h3>Inspectable by humans</h3><p>Good engineering should remain understandable to its next maintainer.</p></article></div></section>

      <section class="technology-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / BUILD SOMETHING</p><h2>Have a problem that deserves <span>better technology?</span></h2><p>Websites, applications, automation, infrastructure, and interactive systems are all versions of the same question: what should the technology make possible?</p></div><a href="/contact">Start a project <span>→</span></a></section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
    <script>
      const componentState=document.querySelector('[data-component-state]'); const signalRing=document.querySelector('[data-signal-ring]');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-component-action]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const action=button.dataset.componentAction;if(!componentState||!signalRing)return;componentState.textContent=action==='activate'?'ACTIVE':'READY';signalRing.classList.toggle('is-active',action==='activate')}));
      const apiStatus=document.querySelector('[data-api-status]'); const apiRun=document.querySelector('[data-api-run]');
      apiRun?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!apiStatus)return;apiStatus.textContent='VALIDATING';apiRun.setAttribute('disabled','true');window.setTimeout(()=>{apiStatus.textContent='200 / ACCEPTED';apiRun.removeAttribute('disabled')},650)});
      const automation=document.querySelector('[data-automation-demo]');
      automation?.querySelector('[data-automation-run]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const nodes=automation.querySelectorAll('.automation-node');nodes.forEach((node,index)=>window.setTimeout(()=>{nodes.forEach((n)=>n.classList.remove('is-active'));node.classList.add('is-active')},index*450))});
      document.querySelector('[data-perf-run]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>document.querySelectorAll('.perf-bars i').forEach((bar,index)=>bar.animate([{transform:'scaleX(.2)'},{transform:'scaleX(1)'}],{duration:500+index*100,fill:'forwards',easing:'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)'})));
      const payloadCode=document.querySelector('[data-payload-code]'); const payloadStatus=document.querySelector('[data-payload-status]'); let valid=true;
      const renderPayload=()=>{if(!payloadCode)return;payloadCode.textContent=JSON.stringify({event:'project.created',source:'web',validated:valid,delivery:'edge'},null,2);if(payloadStatus)payloadStatus.textContent=valid?'VALID':'REVIEW'}; renderPayload();
      document.querySelector('[data-payload-toggle]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{valid=!valid;renderPayload()});
      const details={frontend:'Browser-native interaction, responsive composition, semantic structure, and focused client-side state.',backend:'Typed request boundaries, validation, server-side processing, integrations, and controlled data flow.',automation:'Event-driven workflows that connect services and turn repeated manual work into deterministic actions.',infrastructure:'Deployment, edge delivery, DNS, configuration, observability, caching, and operational boundaries.'};
      const archDetail=document.querySelector('[data-arch-detail]'); document.querySelectorAll('[data-layer]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-layer]').forEach((item)=>item.classList.remove('is-selected'));button.classList.add('is-selected');if(archDetail)archDetail.textContent=details[button.dataset.layer]}));
    </script>
    <style>
      :global(html){background:var(--tech-bg);color:var(--tech-text)}:global(body){--tech-bg:#05070c;--tech-surface:#080c14;--tech-surface-2:#0c111c;--tech-text:#eef2fa;--tech-heading:#f8faff;--tech-muted:#9ca8bd;--tech-soft:#68748b;--tech-border:#20293a;--tech-border-strong:#2c374b;--tech-blue:#6f82ff;--tech-green:var(--brand-green);margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 4%,rgba(111,130,255,.14),transparent 32rem),var(--tech-bg)}main{overflow:hidden}.hero,.capabilities,.lab,.architecture,.principles,.technology-cta{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 90px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:center;padding:90px 0 120px}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.67rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em}.hero h1{max-width:800px;margin:0 0 28px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7.6vw,7.4rem);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.07em}.hero h1 span,h2 span{color:var(--tech-green)}.lede{max-width:690px;margin:0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.8vw,1.3rem);line-height:1.7}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:36px}.hero-link{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:13px 17px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:999px;color:var(--tech-text);text-decoration:none;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:800;transition:.2s ease}.hero-link:hover,.hero-link:focus-visible{border-color:var(--tech-blue);transform:translateY(-2px)}.hero-link--primary{background:var(--tech-green);border-color:var(--tech-green);color:#041006}.hero-console{border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:30px;background:rgba(8,12,20,.86);box-shadow:0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,.4);overflow:hidden}.console-top,.console-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 18px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}.live-dot{color:var(--tech-green)}.live-dot:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--tech-green);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--tech-green)}.console-screen{position:relative;height:390px;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--tech-border);background:#050811}.console-grid{position:absolute;inset:-20%;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(111,130,255,.09) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(111,130,255,.09) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:38px 38px;transform:perspective(300px) rotateX(58deg) translateY(90px)}.console-orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(57,255,90,.28);border-radius:50%;animation:spin 14s linear infinite}.console-orbit--one{width:270px;height:270px}.console-orbit--two{width:350px;height:170px;transform:rotate(35deg);border-color:rgba(111,130,255,.35);animation-direction:reverse}.console-core{position:relative;width:92px;height:92px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#f4fff5,rgba(57,255,90,.8) 10%,rgba(57,255,90,.1) 65%,transparent 70%);box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(57,255,90,.22)}.console-core span{font-size:1rem;font-weight:900;color:#061008}.console-readout{position:absolute;left:22px;bottom:22px;display:grid;gap:5px}.console-readout span{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.57rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.console-readout strong{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--tech-text)}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
      .capabilities{padding:80px 0 150px}.section-intro{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:48px}.section-intro h2,.lab-heading h2,.architecture h2,.principles h2,.technology-cta h2{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em}.section-intro>p:last-child,.lab-heading>p:last-child,.architecture-copy>p:last-child,.technology-cta p:last-child{color:var(--tech-muted);line-height:1.75}.capability-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}.capability-card{position:relative;min-height:430px;padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--tech-surface),#060910);overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .25s ease,transform .25s ease}.capability-card:hover{border-color:#35435d;transform:translateY(-3px)}.capability-card--wide{grid-column:span 2}.card-index{color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.63rem;font-weight:900}.card-kicker{margin:12px 0;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em}.capability-card h3{max-width:620px;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:1.65rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}.capability-card>p:not(.card-kicker){max-width:690px;color:var(--tech-muted);line-height:1.7}.frontend-demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:end;margin-top:30px}.demo-window{min-height:190px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:18px;background:#05080e;overflow:hidden}.window-bar{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;padding:11px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--tech-border);color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.57rem}.window-bar i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#303a4d}.window-bar span{margin-left:8px}.window-body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:25px;height:145px}.window-body small{display:block;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.window-body strong{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:var(--tech-green);font-size:1.1rem}.signal-ring{width:100px;height:100px;border:1px solid rgba(57,255,90,.35);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:inset 0 0 35px rgba(57,255,90,.04);transition:.4s ease}.signal-ring.is-active{transform:scale(1.12);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(57,255,90,.32),transparent 68%);box-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(57,255,90,.2)}.demo-controls{display:grid;gap:8px}.demo-controls button,.api-demo button,.automation-demo button,.lab-button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:999px;background:var(--tech-surface-2);color:var(--tech-text);padding:9px 13px;font:inherit;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800}.demo-controls button:hover,.api-demo button:hover,.automation-demo button:hover,.lab-button:hover{border-color:var(--tech-green)}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--tech-green);outline-offset:3px}.api-demo{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:18px;background:#05080e}.api-demo>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center}.api-demo span{padding:5px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(111,130,255,.1);color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900}.api-demo strong{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.72rem}.api-demo output{color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:900}.automation-demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin-top:30px}.automation-node{padding:15px 8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:12px;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.58rem;font-weight:900;transition:.25s}.automation-node.is-active{border-color:var(--tech-green);color:var(--tech-green);background:rgba(57,255,90,.05);box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(57,255,90,.06)}.automation-demo>span{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.7rem}.automation-demo button{grid-column:1 / -1;margin-top:10px}.infra-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:34px}.infra-node{min-height:90px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:16px;background:#05080e}.infra-node small{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.infra-node strong{margin-top:7px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:.9rem}.infra-node--edge{border-color:rgba(57,255,90,.35)}.infra-node--edge strong{color:var(--tech-green)}.infra-line{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tech-border-strong),var(--tech-blue),var(--tech-border-strong))}.infra-branches{grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.infra-branches span{padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:999px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.5rem;font-weight:800}
      .lab{padding:30px 0 150px}.lab-heading{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:45px}.lab-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.lab-panel{min-height:370px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:22px;background:var(--tech-surface)}.panel-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:start}.panel-heading small{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800}.panel-heading h3{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:1.25rem}.panel-heading>span{color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900}.perf-bars{display:grid;gap:20px;margin:40px 0 28px}.perf-bars>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 45px;gap:8px;align-items:center}.perf-bars span,.perf-bars b{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.52rem;font-weight:800}.perf-bars b{text-align:right}.perf-bars i{height:5px;display:block;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tech-green),var(--tech-blue));transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(var(--value))}.audit-list{display:grid;gap:15px;padding:0;margin:35px 0 0;list-style:none}.audit-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start}.audit-list li>span{color:var(--tech-green);font-weight:900}.audit-list strong,.audit-list small{display:block}.audit-list strong{color:var(--tech-text);font-size:.7rem}.audit-list small{margin-top:4px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.58rem}.lab-panel pre{min-height:185px;margin:35px 0 20px;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:14px;background:#04070c;color:#aeb9cc;font:500 .65rem/1.8 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.lab-panel code{white-space:pre}.lab-button{display:block}
      .architecture{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:90px;align-items:center;padding:70px 0 150px;border-top:1px solid var(--tech-border)}.architecture-stack{border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--tech-surface)}.arch-layer{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 20px;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:20px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--tech-border);background:transparent;color:var(--tech-text);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font:inherit}.arch-layer:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}.arch-layer>span{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.58rem;font-weight:900}.arch-layer strong,.arch-layer small{display:block}.arch-layer strong{font-size:.85rem}.arch-layer small{margin-top:4px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.57rem}.arch-layer b{color:var(--tech-soft);font-weight:400}.arch-layer.is-selected{background:rgba(57,255,90,.045)}.arch-layer.is-selected strong,.arch-layer.is-selected b{color:var(--tech-green)}.arch-detail{padding:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--tech-border);color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.7}.principles{padding-bottom:150px}.principles-head{margin-bottom:45px}.principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--tech-border);border:1px solid var(--tech-border)}.principle-grid article{min-height:170px;padding:27px;background:var(--tech-surface)}.principle-grid span{color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.57rem;font-weight:900}.principle-grid h3{margin:15px 0 10px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:1rem}.principle-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.7}.technology-cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:50px;align-items:end;padding:80px 0 150px;border-top:1px solid var(--tech-border)}.technology-cta>div{max-width:820px}.technology-cta h2{margin-bottom:18px}.technology-cta a{display:inline-flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:16px 21px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--tech-green);color:#041006;text-decoration:none;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(57,255,90,.12)}
      @media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:global(html){background:#fff}:global(body){--tech-bg:#fff;--tech-surface:#f5f7fb;--tech-surface-2:#eef2f7;--tech-text:#253047;--tech-heading:#0e1420;--tech-muted:#60708b;--tech-soft:#738099;--tech-border:#dfe5ee;--tech-border-strong:#c7d0de;--tech-blue:#5265dc;--tech-green:var(--brand-green-dark);background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 4%,rgba(82,101,220,.08),transparent 32rem),var(--tech-bg)}.hero-console,.demo-window,.api-demo,.lab-panel pre,.console-screen{background:#f5f7fb}.console-core span{color:#fff}.capability-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f5f7fb)}}
      @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding-top:80px}.capability-card--wide{grid-column:auto}.capability-grid,.lab-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.architecture{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.technology-cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}}
      @media(max-width:620px){.hero,.capabilities,.lab,.architecture,.principles,.technology-cta{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}.hero{padding:65px 0 90px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,15vw,5rem)}.console-screen{height:310px}.capability-card{padding:23px;min-height:0}.frontend-demo{grid-template-columns:1fr}.demo-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.automation-demo{grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr}.infra-map{grid-template-columns:1fr}.infra-line{width:1px;height:24px;justify-self:center}.infra-branches{flex-wrap:wrap}.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.technology-cta a{justify-self:start}}
      @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.console-orbit{animation:none}.capability-card,.hero-link,.signal-ring,.automation-node{transition:none}}
